            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s11882-016-0626-5</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Drug allergy affects a large percentage of the general population. A listed drug allergy can also have broad implications for many aspects of patient care. Here, we will review recent advances in the arena of drug allergies with a focus on antibiotics, monoclonals, NSAIDs, and chemotherapeutics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
